  "description": "All YITAMOTOR products have one thing in common – they offer the best possible performance and dependability.\nYou get a great upgraded towing mirror that meets the same standards set for factory mirrors and they mount in the same location for easy installation.\nWith strict quality control standards, the replacement mirrors are steady and have no vibration even at highway speeds when driving.\nProvide a better and wider angle of rear view, which improves visibility and reduces blind spots to ensure the safety of drivers and passengers.\nEnhance the Style of the Vehicle and make your vehicle stand out on the road.\nFitment\n1999-2007 Ford F250 F350 F450 F550 Super Duty\n2001-2005 Ford Excursion\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nFitment: compatible with 1999 2000 2001 2002 2003 2004 2005 2006 2007 F250 F350 F450 F550 Super Duty, 2001-2005 Excursion\nPackage contents & dimensions: the left driver side tow mirror, side mirror length is 11” (closed) and 14” (extended); side mirror size is 15”×12”\nFunctions: featuring power adjustable and heated mirror, led signal lights, puddle light, manual folding and Telescoping, the multifunctional side mirrors can strikingly enhance your driving experience\nEasy to install: just simply connect the plugs of the trailer towing mirror to the corresponding power cord, no drilling or modifications required（professional installation would be highly recommended）\nNote: please check if your vehicle has the same functions as that of towing mirrors, such as turn signal, otherwise some functions of towing mirrors will be disabled when the vehicle does not possess the corresponding functions",
